@startuml

hide footbox

title US004 - Register an Appraisal Entity

box #LightYellow
actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":RegisterAppraisalController" as RegisterAppraisalController

participant ":AppraisalEntityRepository" as AppraisalEntityRepository

' Human communication started by Administrator
Administrator -> UI : **1** I want to register an Appraisal Entity in the system
UI -->> Administrator : **2** Provide name and contact for the Appraisal Entity
Administrator -> UI : **3** For the new Appraisal Entity (apEntityXPTO), here's the name and contact

' First contact between UI and the System
UI -> RegisterAppraisalController : **4** registerAppraisalEntity(name, contact)
activate RegisterAppraisalController

' Communication between RegisterAppraisalController and AppraisalEntityRepository
RegisterAppraisalController -> AppraisalEntityRepository : **5** createAndRegisterAppraisalEntity(name, contact)
activate AppraisalEntityRepository

' Creation of new AppraisalEntity
create "apEntityXPTO: AppraisalEntity" as AppraisalEntity

' Creation, validation and addition made in AppraisalEntityRepository
AppraisalEntityRepository -> AppraisalEntity : **6** create(name, contact)
AppraisalEntityRepository -> AppraisalEntityRepository : **7** validateAppraisalEntity(apEntityXPTO)
AppraisalEntityRepository -> AppraisalEntityRepository : **8** addToAppraisalEntityList(apEntityXPTO)

' Return from AppraisalEntityRepository to RegisterAppraisalController
AppraisalEntityRepository --> RegisterAppraisalController : **9** New apEntityXPTO created and added to the list
deactivate AppraisalEntityRepository

' Return from RegisterAppraisalConstroller to the UI
RegisterAppraisalController --> UI : **10** Success
deactivate RegisterAppraisalController

' Return from UI to Administrator
UI --> Administrator : **11** Success

@enduml